{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15109190","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15109190","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1510919001:1":{"text":"페르세우스, 넌 아무 데도 못 가!","source_cn":"珀尔修斯，你休想离开！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBB5EE171475EB82A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1510919002:0":{"text":"오르파가, 그만해라... 그만! 더 이상 아쿠보르가 보칼리스를 피로 물들이는 일은 없을 것이다!","source_cn":"奥法迦，够了……！雅库伯尔不会再让呼临流血！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDA9A8A64544D43EF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1510919003:0":{"text":"왜 몰라주는 거야?\n...난 네가 내 옆에 있기를 바랐던 것뿐이야! 네가 네 입으로 약속했던 거잖아!","source_cn":"你为何还不懂？\\n——我只想要你留在我身边！这是你亲口...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7D40D89ED239D61C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1510919004:1":{"text":"먼저 약속을 어긴 건 너야! 네가 날 배신한 거라고!","source_cn":"是你食言在先！是你背叛了我！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAFACDF146E11E1EF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1510919005:1":{"text":"하지만 괜찮아... 어떤 수를 써서라도 네가 그 약속을 지키게 만들 테니까!","source_cn":"但是没关系……我会帮你实现诺言——不管用什么办法！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA6194FF092F11BEE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_ti